BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (    e, their waters barely sustaining the land.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (  One day, the River of Giving made a bold choice. "I shall pour my waters into your bed," it sa) Tj ET
