BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (        Both prospered beyond measure.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (      The valley elders learned to call this the Dance of Flowing Abundance: when the higher tru) Tj ET
